{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The heartbeat producer excludes observers from nonzero ReadIndex confirmation requests, which counters the initial concern that observer replies could supply a quorum. A separate batching path looks suspicious: replies to earlier forwarded reads appear to use the newest read’s context. I’ll trace how callers generate and match those contexts."}}
